{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_03BE50","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"从这里开始就是云雾林。植被一直茂密到地面。能藏身的地方很多，但对敌人来说也一样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"<R=侦察,SCOUT>兵吗……！","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=侦察,SCOUT>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":31,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"硬闯等于自杀。先掌握敌人的位置。要是有雷达一类的东西就好了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"或者用<R=夜视装置,NVG>……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=夜视装置,NVG>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":38,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"知道敌人的位置，就有办法对付了。可以从他们的死角前进……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"或者我们也用狙击枪先发制人。以眼还眼。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""}]}